{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1549944-how-have-you-used-lilith-in-your-games","id":1549944,"title":"How have you used Lilith in your games?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-04-08T09:00:53-07:00","id":1549944,"title":"How have you used Lilith in your games?","content":"Exactly as the title says, I'm considering using Lilith in my Chronicle but have no experience with using the Aeons from either side of the screen, so I'm hoping for some stories about her to see if she'll fit into what I'm trying to do (a Supernal Entity resurrection)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-08T17:42:57-07:00","id":1549958,"title":"","content":"Lilith is the anithesis of the Father, the counterbalance. If he is about blind faith and crushing obedience, she will tempt with indulgence and thoughtless passion. Not because she thinks its the right path, but to provide contrast. She is interested in one thing: &quot;Do what thou Will&quot;.<br /> <br /> Lilith wants people to find their True Will, their purpose that aligns with their true inner self, like a greater daimon. Its where her actions, deals and guidance will lead a visitor. Much like an Obrimos using Mage Sight, she sees the True glorious potential of the individual. But they cannot truly understand and internalize it if they do not struggle, reflect and are challenged in their convictions. So she manipulates them onto the path, until they can see the truth. Some rumors claim that moment of realization once resonated with a warlock, so they sought to embody this Truth, thus the Concord of Serpents was founded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-20T12:57:05-07:00","id":1550288,"title":"","content":"DaveB said &quot;Lilith represents raw willpower, regardless of opposition - she's Hubris personified. The idea that the mage, and the mage alone, gets to decide what's what for the universe.&quot; Which is a scary thought, but definitely gives some good inspiration","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-23T12:34:28-07:00","id":1550346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aendrinastor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1549944-how-have-you-used-lilith-in-your-games?p=1550288#post1550288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DaveB said &quot;Lilith represents raw willpower, regardless of opposition - she's Hubris personified. The idea that the mage, and the mage alone, gets to decide what's what for the universe.&quot; Which is a scary thought, but definitely gives some good inspiration</div> </div> </div> </div>I did say that, but I was semi-quoting Signs of Sorcery:<br /> <br /> The Immanent Temple of the Aether, Citadel of Lilith<br /> and Azazel: A great temple combines the symbols of every religion<br /> that ever posited a transcendental Above or enlightened<br /> Within. At its heart, the Syzygy of the Aether sit on either<br /> side of a great altar. Azazel of Forces was once chief of the<br /> grigori, rebel angels and culture heroes. He taught humanity<br /> to harness fire. Lilith of Prime rules the urges that conquer<br /> any civilization Azazel\u2019s pupils can build. She is anima, the<br /> Awakened \u201ctrue will.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-23T17:11:34-07:00","id":1550351,"title":"","content":"I'll be honest your semi-quote makes me sense to me than an awakened true will. Knowing what that term means in hindsight I can see it but I dont think I would have come to that conclusion if I had just read it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-24T17:06:15-07:00","id":1550367,"title":"","content":"The description sounds like she distorts the concept of True Will from Thelema, want and hubris woven into one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-24-2025, 08:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-06T12:19:15-08:00","id":1556262,"title":"","content":"Do Aeons have Royal Avatars? If so, that gives the Storyteller more mileage out of Lilith!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28921-creatorfoundermaker","name":"CreatorFounderMaker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-06T14:03:54-08:00","id":1556267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CreatorFounderMaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1549944-how-have-you-used-lilith-in-your-games?p=1556262#post1556262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do Aeons have Royal Avatars? If so, that gives the Storyteller more mileage out of Lilith!</div> </div> </div> </div>Royal Avatars are primarily the province of spirits and the Aeons are capable of casting Imperial spells as instant actions without Quintessences. As Astral beings at the farthest shores of comprehensible reality who largely adhere to the pretense that they are confined to their Citadels, it would be quite strange for them to manifest avatars outside those confines instead of, say, sending servants or recruiting agents in the manner typical to their presentation (whether that's Typhon sending Typhonides to keep breaking down the Spire Perilous or whatever service they might ask of mages seeking the Auctoritas).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}